---
const currently = [
  { k: 'Building', v: 'A prompt manager', d: 'a Chrome extension that carries context across AIs' },
  { k: 'Exploring', v: 'AI tools and APIs', d: 'Claude, GPT, building and breaking things' },
  { k: 'Training', v: 'Gym and badminton', d: 'gym 5×, badminton 2×' },
  { k: 'Listening', v: 'Lo-fi work music', d: 'always on, no distractions' },
];
---

<section id="about">
  <h2 class="section t2">About</h2>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      At DataPOEM I work on an enterprise decision AI platform that large
      consumer brands use to plan and optimize marketing budgets. I own the
      identity platform, lead the frontend, and build features and core services
      that clients use in production. Most recently I took an AI planning workspace from the
      product team's idea to launch.
    </p>
    <p>
      What I care about: systems that stay correct under pressure, interfaces
      that stay fast at real data volumes, and codebases that are easier to work
      in after I've touched them.
    </p>
    <p>
      I came to software from mechanical engineering. I spent two and a half
      years at TCS supporting enterprise data-science platforms on Azure, then
      asked to move into React development. I joined DataPOEM with a frontend
      title, the work went fullstack, and the title caught up in April 2026.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h3 class="sub">Currently</h3>
  <dl class="currently">
    {currently.map((c) => (
      <div class="row">
        <dt>{c.k}</dt>
        <dd>
          <span class="v">{c.v}</span>
          <span class="d">{c.d}</span>
        </dd>
      </div>
    ))}
  </dl>
</section>

<style>
  .prose p {
    color: var(--ink-2);
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    max-width: 40em;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }
  .prose p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  h3.sub {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink-3);
    margin: 32px 0 4px;
  }
  /* subgrid so the label column lines up across rows */
  .currently {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 96px minmax(0, 1fr);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: subgrid;
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 11px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule-2);
  }
  .row:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }
  dt {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--ink-3);
  }
  dd {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 15px;
  }
  .v {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .d {
    color: var(--ink-3);
  }
  .d::before {
    content: " · ";
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .currently {
      grid-template-columns: 80px minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
    .d {
      display: block;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .d::before {
      content: none;
    }
  }
</style>
